# The title, Settings (the runtime's Options), and the club day's controls
# by pointer and keys: choosing friends (their buttons, their board cells and
# F), the direction pad, Serve, Tidy and Hint with the refusals they explain.
until 300 =Play
frames 10
expect Offline — progress is stored on this device.
click =Settings
until 120 Accessibility
frames 20
key F1 2
frames 30
key Escape 2
frames 30
until 60 =Play
frames 10
click =Play
until 60 Clubhouse floor
frames 10
expect Wants Paint · 11 patience
click =Momo
frames 5
until 30 Momo selected.
frames 5
click Move right
frames 5
until 30 That would leave the clubhouse.
frames 5
click =Tidy
frames 5
until 30 No messy station is within reach.
key KeyF 1
frames 5
until 30 Pip selected.
frames 5
click =Row 3, column 4: Momo
frames 5
until 30 Momo selected.
frames 5
click =Serve wish
frames 5
until 30 Stand on a station to serve.
frames 5
click =Hint
frames 5
until 30 Hint: move down with
frames 5
click Move down
frames 5
until 30 Served 0/3 · Turns 1
frames 30
save screens-game
